<h1>Kyna Lenhof</h1>
<p>Chicago Board of Education, District 2b, on the Chicago ballot November 3, 2026.</p>
<h2>Running on</h2>
<p>Lenhof has committed to the Illinois Families for Public Schools Pledge to Protect Human-Centered Education, which calls for a three-year moratorium on generative AI use in CPS, a district chief privacy officer, limits on screen time in all grades, and a ban on collecting biometric data. Beyond that pledge, she has not published a campaign website or platform statements that we could find as of September 2026.</p>
<h2>Background</h2>
<p>Lenhof is a former CPS educator and serves as treasurer of the 40th Ward Democratic Ward Committee.</p>
